*6 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
*5 [[Sir Rel]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
